Package: timescales
Title: Nested Timeframes and Calendars for Optimization and Simulation Models
Version: 0.5.3
Date: 2026-08-27
URL: https://optimal2050.github.io/timescales/r/,
    https://optimal2050.github.io/timescales/,
    https://github.com/optimal2050/timescales
BugReports: https://github.com/optimal2050/timescales/issues
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Oleg",
           family = "Lugovoy",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "olugovoy@optimalsolution.dev",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5546-9875"))
Description: Discrete time representations for optimization and simulation
    models, including calendar-based nested sets of timeframes, conversion
    between alternative temporal resolutions, and mapping of data onto
    calendar grids for modeling and visualization. Successor to the
    'timeslices' package, designed as the time-domain companion to
    'geoscales'.
